Z||000034||84Bill||06-14-2001||11:39 AM||||   <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by ChadMan:<BR><B>The airhorns in "Speed Shot" are so damned cool.  Whose are those and where can I get a set?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>I think JC Whitney has them. <P>3 horn set like this one <A HREF="http://www.jcwhitney.com/product.jhtml?CATID=4549&BQ=jcw2" TARGET=_blank>http://www.jcwhitney.com/product.jhtml?CATID=4549&BQ=jcw2</A> <P>I was surprised when I found my car had them but were not working because of a bad relay.  I replaced the relay with one from my donor car (fuelpump relay)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I think I have the same set as Skitime (lead car) because they sound exactly the same.<P>BTW they are so loud it will blurr your vision  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by 84Bill (edited 06-14-2001).]||||reg||14
